  "foaf:name": "Blue House Fellowship Programme",
  "sdo:name": "Blue House Fellowship Programme",
  "sdo:description": "The  Blue House Fellowship Programme is  contributing to the identification of critical ocean knowledge, building capacity and generating knowledge among stakeholders, and increasing the use of ocean knowledge to support the conservation, cultivation and sustainable management of kelp forests (wild and cultivated).",
